    "steps": [
      {
        "boundary": "Owned focus and Alt+F4 injection",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "scripts/quality/native-input-linux.py",
        "source_lines": "989-1001 and 1172-1203",
        "sha256": "d418af1488908141482e5adc83a3b3bae2c2a36a67be42bb6684d34947916756",
        "behavior": "focus() verifies the window's owner and active focus, then the driver runs xdotool key --clearmodifiers alt+F4 and waits five seconds. A separate bounded read-only probe follows the original decision. Command completion does not acknowledge WM close delivery."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "WM_DELETE_WINDOW reception and dispatch",
        "repository": "zed-industries/zed",
        "path": "crates/gpui_linux/src/linux/x11/client.rs",
        "source_lines": "905-916",
        "sha256": "9312432f6a5cea2e816dea192395faf92fe8e88bc52d35e0eb13d090283fc6b4",
        "behavior": "The ClientMessage branch looks up the window, recognizes WM_DELETE_WINDOW, calls should_close(), then window.close(). The retained run has no marker at entry or exit of this branch."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Native close predicate",
        "repository": "zed-industries/zed",
        "path": "crates/gpui_linux/src/linux/x11/window.rs",
        "source_lines": "1051-1060",
        "sha256": "87b737ecda518123196c3f60369120c6a8fb8021b43a4830cc21bf7834eda438",
        "behavior": "should_close() invokes an installed callback when present and otherwise returns true. This source behavior is not evidence that the failed run reached this call."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "GPUI removal observer",
        "repository": "zed-industries/zed",
        "path": "crates/gpui/src/app.rs",
        "source_lines": "3243-3266",
        "behavior": "After window.removed is observed and GPUI removes its window/handle bookkeeping, it invokes window_closed_observers. No intermediate removal trace is retained in this case."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Session native marker before transport Closed",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "native/gpui-host/src/session.rs",
        "source_lines": "57-85",
        "behavior": "The existing on_window_closed observer finds and removes the session's matching window, marks it inactive, calls evidence.closed(window_id), then cancels clipboard ownership and emits transport Closed when not finishing."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Passive native removal evidence",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "native/gpui-host/src/evidence.rs",
        "source_lines": "199-221",
        "behavior": "Evidence::closed writes native_window_closed through the same optional bounded append/flush writer used for native evidence. It observes removal, not WM delivery or transport receipt. The six successful cases contain this marker; the failed case does not. No close-evidence write error is present in its retained stderr. Absence alone is not proof of which earlier boundary failed."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Template lifecycle acknowledgement",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "scripts/native/project.ts",
        "source_lines": "64-86",
        "behavior": "The unchanged generated app waits for window.closed, view.closed or its stop signal; finalization disposes the view, shuts down the application, awaits application.closed, then sends the zero-resource stopped acknowledgement."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Owner interruption and joined failure cleanup",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "tests/native/cli-template-owner.ts",
        "behavior": "The shared owner marks SIGINT/SIGTERM as interruption, forces only on an already-failed path, and joins the application process and IPC disconnect. The failed record reports interruption and a missing stopped acknowledgement."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Unattributed EOF diagnostic",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "packages/runtime/src/index.ts",
        "source_lines": "321-333",
        "behavior": "The runtime reports Native output closed before shutdown when the native stdout stream ends outside stopping/closed. The retained stderr has no timestamp; it does not establish whether this condition preceded or resulted from later forced cleanup."
      },
      {
        "boundary": "Different fixture's optional phase sites",
        "repository": "0xPlayerOne/bun-native",
        "path": "tests/native/public-lifecycle.ts",
        "behavior": "The seven closePhase sites belong to the public-lifecycle fixture, not these unchanged installed CLI templates. The failed case's empty phases array is not seven instrumented phases reporting failure."
      }
    ],
    "exact_remaining_gap": "The records do not distinguish Alt+F4 delivery/WM handling, GPUI ClientMessage receipt/close handling, or progression into native removal. There is no demonstrated causal code fix from this observation."
